        "TileImage": "$($repository 5ac2e193-5309-4ed8-a759-7019abc15b94).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned the following High Value Targets (HVTs) at an isolated apricot farm in Colorado, USA. Below are the list of targets as well as the preferred methods for apprehending them;\r\rEliminate Reggie Duncan with a pistol headshot.\rEliminate Lloyd &quot;Pointman&quot; Burgess with an electricution.\rEliminate Milton Geiger with the car lift.\rEliminate Robert Powell with a gas explosion.\r\rThe occupied militia are highly armed and hostile. Avoid contact at any cost.  \r\rBest of luck!\rReapingZ",
